From: N0zoM1z0 <161784452+N0zoM1z0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:04:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [th02/main] Decompile the stage enemy script interpreter,
 spawner and movement helpers

The enemy TU starts with a null callback at 0x16A66, which keeps the -a2
switch tables of enemy_script_run() at the original even offset. A
following read of the same far array element reuses ES only when no jump
label sits between the two reads.
---
 th02/main/enemy/enemy.cpp |  422 +++++++++++-
 th02/main/enemy/enemy.hpp |    8 +-
 th02_main.asm             | 1358 +------------------------------------
 3 files changed, 431 insertions(+), 1357 deletions(-)

diff --git a/th02/main/enemy/enemy.cpp b/th02/main/enemy/enemy.cpp
index 4e6fb0c7..88658525 100644
--- a/th02/main/enemy/enemy.cpp
+++ b/th02/main/enemy/enemy.cpp
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
